<title>USA: Poe &amp; Brown names Zimmer CFO.</title>
<headline>Poe &amp; Brown names Zimmer CFO.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTONA BEACH, Fla. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poe &amp; Brown Inc said Tuesday that it has named William Zimmer chief financial officer, effective May 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Prior to assuming this position Zimmer was assistant vice president of finance for the company.</p>
<p>James Orchard, who has been CFO the past two years, is assuming responsibility for the company's Professional Protector Plan, a nationwide insurance program for dentists.</p>
</text>
